OL,3,GNEWSA'We need #1m to save our church
OL,4,Afrom falling down'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vestry wall is leaning at an
OL,7,Falarming angle, the steeple is badly
OL,8,Frusted, and it seems likely the church
OL,9,Fcould be added to Historic England's
OL,10,FHeritage At Risk Register.
OL,12,FLast year, St Mary's Church in Astbury,
OL,13,FCheshire, even had to close for three
OL,14,Fmonths in an attempt to slash its
OL,15,Fenergy bills.
OL,17,FIt is an "amazing building", according
OL,18,Fto the woman in charge, Reverend
OL,19,FHeather Carter, and people often say,
OL,20,F"Wow", when they enter, but it is now
OL,21,Fdesperately in need of cash to sort out
OL,22,Fits creaking structure.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
