OL,3,GNEWSA'We need #1m to save our church
OL,4,Afrom falling down'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraising campaign to bring in #1m
OL,7,Fhas been launched - but this may only
OL,8,Fbe the very start of what is needed to
OL,9,Fstop it from falling down, she said.
